TS29571_CommonData:Pei a rdfs:Datatype ;
    rdfs:comment """String representing a Permanent Equipment Identifier that may contain - an IMEI or IMEISV, as  specified in clause 6.2 of 3GPP TS 23.003; a MAC address for a 5G-RG or FN-RG via  wireline  access, with an indication that this address cannot be trusted for regulatory purpose if this  address cannot be used as an Equipment Identifier of the FN-RG, as specified in clause 4.7.7  of 3GPP TS23.316. Examples are imei-012345678901234 or imeisv-0123456789012345. 
""" .

